~ start
if not PlayerStats.in_photo
	match PlayerStats.scene_progress
		when 0
			Max: The official Lolo Martin leather jacket from the hit series "Ang Maynila Boy"???
			Max: My dad would LOVE to have this.
			Max: Copping this for sure.
			$> PlayerStats.has_clothes = true
		when 2
			Max: I've already gathered enough pasalubong.
else
	Max: I can't exactly grab anything from the past.
=> END